# C5 guard (bring-up plan): fwupd's scsi plugin can offer UFS firmware
# updates (org.jedec.ufs, SCSI WRITE BUFFER). There is no public recovery
# loader for this tablet, so no tool that can write its UFS firmware is
# allowed on the system. ubuntu-desktop-minimal pulls fwupd + fwupd-signed
# through Recommends; this pin keeps apt from ever installing them. Remove
# this file (and the masks in the device package) only with a tested
# recovery path for the storage controller.
Package: fwupd fwupd-signed
Pin: release *
Pin-Priority: -1
